window.products.push({"id":605135,"name":"Elegant Bottom Colored Wine Glasses, Set of 4 (20 Oz Goblets)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315IZHDEPgS._AC_.jpg","description":"Palais wine glasses curve to perfectly fit in your hand, and this stemless wine glass can be conveniently washed in the dishwasher. These fine wine glasses not only add beauty to your bar top, they also brilliantly combine stability, resilience, and astounding practicality. This lavish glass wine set is cut for uniformly thin rims and a satisfyingly smooth and slender stem that is easy to grip. They are sturdy and a nice shape. You can put them in the dishwasher and not worry about chipping. This is the perfect wine glass set to give as a gift to the wine or home design enthusiast. They come in an attractive gift box and are terrific for Dinner, Parties, Wedding Gifts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315IZHDEPgS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palais Essentials","source_asin":"B08N5CQ5B5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N5CQ5B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N5CQ5B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":605136,"name":"BLRON Kitchen Storage Cabinet,Microwave Oven Stand with 5 Storage Shelves,Kitchen Baker’s Rack with 1 Cabinet,Bookshelf Cabinet,Bathroom,Shoe Racks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k3l3Jw2hL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","description":"AMPLE STORAGE SPACE: With 4 shelves and a 2-door cabinet, this kitchen baker's rack provides large storage room to make your kitchen neat and tidy. the top of cabinet well accommodates your microwave oven, coffee maker. 4-tier shelf can be used to place fruits, veggies, dishes, wine bottles or other items. MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SHELF: The kitchen baker rack is a great choice to be your kitchenware storage shelf. In addition, it can also be used as multipurpose workstation Shelf, office storage rack, bookshelf ,wine Rack or bathroom storage rack. It can match well with any style furniture and provide you with more storage space in your home and office. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: This storage shelves with 1 cabinet come with picture directions, every part is clearly marked and you will find it very interesting to assemble our kitchen floor cabinet, just like a jigsaw puzzle. SIZE: 31.5\"L x 11.8\"W x 28\"H，we provide a simple screwdriver, if you feel inconvenient to use, you can use a household tool screwdriver. We provide friendly customer service for all products, if you have any question, please contact us by email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k3l3Jw2hL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLRON","source_asin":"B08B1NW21F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B1NW21F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B1NW21F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":605137,"name":"WJHGJTHY Microfiber Bathroom Rugs（16\"×24\" Dark Brown） Non Slip Mat Ultra Soft Shaggy and Absorbent Machine Washable Thick Plush Bath Rug for Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bb4PPcP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT and FLUFFY: The bath rug is constructed with thick upgraded and ultra high-density polyester microfiber shags which can make the mat softer and more fluffy. The soft pile has been reinforced to avoid shedding and help soothe tried feet. SUPER ABSORBENT: The microfiber shag bath mat is much more absorbent than other materials. It can quickly and efficiently absorb dripping water while you’re stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Owing to the fluffy piles, moisture evaporates fast, making the rugs dry rapidly. ️NON SLIP RUBBER BACKING: This bathroom mat features TPR rubber backing which is non-slip and durable for long lasting use. This anti-skid backing helps keeping the mat firmly in place, that it won’t shift or skid, keeping you more safe and cozy. Please place the rug on CLEAN and DRY FLOOR only. Water or dust under rug can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of rug dry and clean. MACHINE WASHABLE: The bathroom rug is super easy to clean. Machine wash in cold water with mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay to air dry, the color will not fade with continual uses. MULTIPLE USES: The bath mat can be widely used in various occasions, such as bathroom, living room, study room, hallway, bedroom, balcony, bathtub side. Please choose one of your favorite colors to match the home decoration perfectly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bb4PPcP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WJHGJTHY","source_asin":"B0B25DZZW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B25DZZW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B25DZZW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
