window.products.push({"id":605184,"name":"GOODiTREE Fondue Forks Set of 12 with Storage Box Mini Cheese Pot Chocolate Fountain Party Stainless Steel 9.5\" Roasting Sticks Dessert Skewers Heat R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sN5rmWBUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT ALL-ROUND VALUE PERFECT GIFT FOR THE PRICE - These fondue forks are extremely easy to use. Leave a lasting impression on your guest with these colorful design fondue forks. Lightweight, stainless steel handles and small enough to fit in the palm. Take your family dinners, picnics and camping gatherings to a whole new level. Sharing high quality chocolate fondue at parties has never been easier. Fondu forks experience in fondue dips makes some of the most comforting foods imaginable. PREMIUM QUALITY WITH BEAUTIFULLY STYLED HANDLES - This fondue fork set features a stainless steel base, self adjust rotary control enable even heat distribution that lets you warm everything from milk chocolate, gruyere cheese or, roast marshmallows. Perfect for wedding reception, birthday party, picnic and camping. Forks long enough to put in a fondue dip of your choice and eat. It’s safe, reliable, well made, color coded, and just what you need for your next dinner party. FUN TO USE WITH EYE-CATCHING DISPLAY - Set of beautifully designed fondue forks in 6 colours make it easy to differentiate among the guests. No more sharing forks. Each person picks their favorite colour. It’s 9.5” long makes it distant enough from the stove and provides even heat distribution across its entire length. Food grade stainless-steel fondue forks dips in the hot melting cheese fondue without worries. A unique combination of authentic quality, tasteful design and a dash of tradition. EASY TO CLEAN AND DISHWASHER SAFE - Forks are dishwasher safe and reusable. With sticky food on forks, it's advisable to hand wash immediately after. Lightweight and durable making it easy to wash. Handles are stainless steel making it comfortable in the palms so that you can set it up easily for your next coming guest. Guests get to prepare, interact with each other, eat delicious meals and get to leave with it. Functionally attractive, and it's one of the best-looking sets on the market. ARRIVES IN AN ECO-FRIENDLY STORAGE BOX - Maintain excitement of your guest outside your home such as in picnics and camping adventures. This fondue forks are super lightweight and small making them suitable to travel with them. Set of 12 and set of 18 comes in an ECO-Friendly storage box so that all can be put in place and easily stored. Owning a fondue pot with many fondue sticks like this one enables you to take an even bigger crowd with you. Keep your guest engaged!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sN5rmWBUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoodiTree","source_asin":"B08NYNHGHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NYNHGHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NYNHGHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
