window.products.push({"id":605249,"name":"gohantee Fireplace Stove Fan 5-Blades, Silent Motors Heat Powered Stove Fan Circulates Warm/Heated Air Eco Stove Fan with Thermometer, for Gas/Pellet/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615YnSaapQL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","description":"[FUNCTION] The 5 blades stove fan speed up air circulation and improve the efficiency of fireplace fans, to heat your room quickly. It widely used for wood burning stove, gas stove, pellet stove and more. A thermometer included to monitor the temperature of your stove. [ADVANTAGE] No batteries or electricity required. The stove fan driven by the heat generated by the fireplace or wood burning stove and conducts to the fan base to drive the blades. The temperature of the fireplace affects the speed of the fan. [LOW NOISE IN OPERATION] The fan will work at less than 25db, heat around room and increase temperature with low noise. Reduce wood consumption from your stove and provide greater comfort. More stable and environmental protection. [PREMIUM QUALITY] The fan base and blade are made from anodized aluminum which is rust-proof, wear-resisting, with good thermal conductivity. Overheating protection, the in-built bi-metallic strip at the base of the stove fan is designed to raise the edge of the fan slightly as the maximum operating temperature is approached to protect the motor and the moelectric module. [OPERATING TEMPERATURE] The working temperature of the fan is 122°F - 662°F (50°C - 350°C).Recommended surface temperature is between 392°F - 644°F(200-340°C) Don't over 350°C(662°F), avoid damage to the components due to overheating. The purpose of this fan is to spread hot air to entire house, so the wind cannot be too strong. The design of fan blades is also designed according to the effect, but the effect is not so good when the blade is large. If the wind is strong, it will cause cold wind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615YnSaapQL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gohantee","source_asin":"B08NPQDR2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NPQDR2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NPQDR2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
