window.products.push({"id":605323,"name":"Waterford Classic Personalized 8x10 Picture Frame, Custom Engraved Silver Plated 8x10 Frame for Wedding, Anniversary, Baby, Graduation, Family Photos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c4VorfcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATERFORD PERSONALIZED CLASSIC 8X10 PICTURE FRAME Display, preserve and protect your most cherished memories while adding a striking touch to your home decor with the Waterford Classic 8x10 Picture Frame. With its sleek, contemporary look with clean lines, the heavy-duty Waterford Classic 8x10 Frame borders your most cherished 8x10 photos with the look of gleaming silver. These frames are silver-plated and have a lacquer finish so that they will never tarnish. While Waterford is a pioneer in design, sometimes the most simple patterns remain the most popular. That's certainly the case with the Classic Collection, which features a timeless frame design, recognizable in style to all. This frame presents a prestigious option for special pictures, such as wedding, anniversary, baby or family photos. Each frame includes a glass photo cover to protect your photos from dust, fading, and wear. The sturdy built-in easel makes this frame suitable for display on any table, shelf, mantle, or desk. Each frame comes presented in Waterford Signature Gift Box Packaging. INCLUDED ENGRAVING SERVICE Our team of professionals will make each frame one of a kind with our included engraving service. Select a font style and add any text of your choosing to the top and/or bottom of the frame to create a luxurious gift with a personal touch for someone special to you. Click 'Customize Now' to begin your order and review engraving options. ITEM SPECIFICATIONS Manufacturer: Waterford Model: Classic 8x10 Picture Frame Model Number: W3080 Overall Dimensions: 10\"W x 12\"H x 1\"D Photo Size: 8x10 Orientation: Portrait (Vertical) Display Type: Table Top Built-In Easel Protective Glass Photo Cover Tarnish-Proof Silver Plated Finish Includes Gray Protective Pouch for Safe Storage, Transport, and Presentation Waterford Signature Gift Box Packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c4VorfcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B079MF6266","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MF6266","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MF6266","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
