window.products.push({"id":605345,"name":"MIKOLY Stainless Steel Bullet Mug Tumbler Thermos - Water Bottle - Double Walled Vacuum Insulated Flask - Outdoor Travel Cup & Mug - Leak Proof & Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HE1nm2BaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No matter you are working in the office, hitting the beach, the trail or the road, the vacuum insulated and double walled thermos is always with you - keeping hot and cold drink for a long time for you & offering you enough water in time. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS OCCASIONS: This thermos can be used in all type of occasion like sports, outdoor working, beach, school, office, picnic, hiking, camping, road trips, traveling, trip, driving, mountaineering, backpacking, yoga classes, gym, fitness. It is Lightweight, sleek, tough, fits most car cup holders, bottle cages & your bag. It is also a perfect travel mug for a drink or a drink while you sleep. SPECIFICATIONS: ● Size: 9.3 x 2.7\"(23.5 x 6.8cm)● Material: 304 Stainless Steel● Cup Cover Material: Food-grade PP & Silicone Sealing Ring● Please remove the desiccant pack inside before first use● Top Cover Material: Plastic Electroplated● Capacity: 17 US fl oz(500 ml / 17.6 UK fl oz)● Color: Copper, Army Green, Gold● Father’s Day Gift PERFECT FOR GIFTING: Fashion pure color design without logo, brand, pictures. Suitable for all ages. Comes in a good box which makes it easy to wrap for a gift for your family, friends on anniversary, birthday, festival, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day. LEAK PROOF & STYLISH DESIGN: Our leak-proof lid is designed with a new insulated & air-tight structure. Airtight stopper prevents liquid leakage, bottle cap can be used as water cup. It has ergonomics & aesthetics bullet shape design, comfortable to use, practical & stylish. KEEP IT HOT AND COLD: This lightweight thermos uses a unique insulation technology to keep your beverages hot and cold. In the summer, you can put some ice in the bottle & enjoy the cool and refreshing under the scorching sun. In the cold winter, bring some hot water or coffee and enjoy the warmth. PACKAGE INCLUDES: ● 1x Stainless Bullet Tumbler","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HE1nm2BaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIKOLY","source_asin":"B095JBD5ZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JBD5ZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JBD5ZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
