window.products.push({"id":605355,"name":"LAISU 6L/1.6Gal Stainless Steel Small Trash Can with Lid Soft Close, Removable Inner Wastebasket, Rectangular Slim Garbage Can, Step Trash Bin for Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KlyHgLT3L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silent Close & Stay Open Lid: Lid shox technology makes the lid slowly and softly close with controlled closure, so it doesn't slam down and make a sound. Innovative mechanism lets the lid stay open for 90 degrees without holding the pedal down for foot free operation or swing closed like traditional step trash can. Anti-Rust & Anti-fingerprint: The garbage can with lid is made of durable commercial-grade brushed stainless steel with rust-free technology. Anti-fingerprint finish keeps the metal trash can looking clean and shiny. No matter what the style of the decoration, a classic stainless steel garbage can is always the right choice. Removable Inner Waste Basket: Having the ability to remove the inner can/liner is so convenient for cleaning and changing out trash. The handle is solid and easily accessible which means all you have to do is grab and pull straight up to remove the inner can. There is a trash bag retaining hole designed in the inner bucket, which can fix the trash bag to avoid slipping off. Excellent Sealing Ability & Dog Proof Trash Can: The slim trash can with lid covers up the smell of trash for a fresh, clean-smelling home. The wastebasket with lid secures your trash and stops your small pets from trashcan diving. Unless your pets tip the whole trash can over, they are probably not going to get the lid open and scatter garbage. Hands-Free Step Trash Can: The metal trash can has a durable steel foot pedal which is engineered to last over 150,000 steps. The step design means you can operate the trash can hands-free. It's important to have a hands-free wastebasket in the bathroom so your hands can stay clean. Compact & Slim Garbage Can: This is a 6 Liter/1.6 Gallon small bathroom trash can. 8.7\"L x 5.9\"W x 11.2\"H, 21.2\"H with lid open. This narrow trash can is perfect for tight spaces such as bathroom, bedroom, office, apartment, nursery, dorm room, powder room, laundry room, between cabinets or at the end of counters, or wherever space is limited. What We Can Support: We offer 1 year warranty, 30 days money back and 24 hours customer service support. If the soft close trash can you received is dented, broken, damaged or the wrong color, please send us an Amazon email to get a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KlyHgLT3L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAISU","source_asin":"B0C2P4ZJ5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2P4ZJ5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2P4ZJ5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
