window.products.push({"id":605454,"name":"EZCOOK Aluminum Kitchen Utensil Tray Drawer Organizer for Silverware Storage, Interlocking Cutlery Holder with Adjustable Dividers for Flatware, Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GW-k7eb+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅[Large Aluminum Cutlery Organizer In Drawer] - EZCOOK adjustable drawer organizer has rectangular compartments in a variety of sizes, it can be used as flatware organizer for drawer, cooking utensils organizer, or kitchen gadgets organizer. You have three sizes to choose, just pick the right one!(18.11\" x 13.78\" x 2.56\" ; 18.11\" x 15.75\" x 2.56\", 18.11\" x 19.69\" x 2.56\") ✅[Flexible Size Adjustment] - Cutlery tray with 3 deep removable dividers,cutlery and kitchen gadgets with up to 6 compartments (6 adjustable).Ideal sized with multiple compartments to fit various sized items like pencils, pens, paper clips, crafting materials, tech/gadget accessories, toiletries, beauty products, grooming tools, and more. ✅[Natural Aluminum Material] - Compared with others’ utensil drawer organizer, most of their materials are bamboo or plastic,it’s very cheap, which will have a lot of scratches and easily deform after a long time use. However, our flatware organizer for drawer is different from those sold in the market, and ours’ are made of Aluminum,it’s very durable. ✅[Simple To Assemble & Easy To Wash]-This kitchen cabinet pan organizer rack can be set up within a minute and requires no tools or complicated installation process.As this the pots and pans organizer under cabinet has smooth aluminum surface, it is easy to clean, you’re free to enjoy the extra space and tidiness in your kitchen for years! ✅[Widely Use] - The utensil drawer organizer can be used to store small items such as jewelry, tools, spoons and knives. also it can be made a good use in the bedroom or bathroom with holding personal items like hair ties, jewelry and other accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GW-k7eb+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZCOOK","source_asin":"B08SM5S4QS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SM5S4QS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SM5S4QS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
