window.products.push({"id":605463,"name":"Gorilla Grip Stainless Steel Balloon Wire Whisk, Heavy Duty Metal Whisks for Cooking, Hand Mixing Kitchen Tool, Egg Beater, For Stirring, Blending, Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ovUZO8ZWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soft Slip Resistant Cool Touch Rubber Handle: a slip resistant, ergonomic contoured handle keeps your hands comfortable while you whisk; perfect for extensive whisking sessions; handle helps make food prep easy Shaped for Maximum Aeration and Effortless Whipping Power: the balloon shaped design makes this the quintessential whisk; it is the go to option for whisking and blending; it features stiff wires which help cut through thick ingredients and help aerate ingredients for maximum efficiency; whisk is narrow enough to scrape the edges of the bowl while you make sauces, but still wide enough to quickly aerate thicker ingredients like cream Durable Stainless Steel Wires Are Flexible, Yet Sturdy: constructed from sturdy and rust resistant stainless steel, the whisk is designed to last a lifetime; flexible enough to reach difficult to reach edges of the bowls, but won’t bend or break, even after prolonged usage with super thick or heavy ingredients Fluffy Whipped Cream, Voluminous Egg Whites, Lump Free Sauces: this durable whisk features large, wide loops that are perfect for everyday use and allow you to blend even the heaviest mixtures with ease; use for whisking, whipping and beating; perfect for mixing dry ingredients, beating eggs, whisking puddings, whipping cream, and so much more; gentle on all kitchenware Dishwasher Safe: easy to clean; whisk is dishwasher safe for a quick and easy clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ovUZO8ZWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorilla Grip","source_asin":"B08LF1KRBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LF1KRBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LF1KRBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":605464,"name":"HIC Kitchen Talisman Pie Baking Set, For Making 8-Inch to 11.5-Inch Pies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HA0O7zUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIC Talisman’s Pie Baking Set creates perfectly round pie crusts that bake to perfection without any burnt edges. The set includes 1 each Easy Pie Crust Maker and Adjustable Pie Shield. The Pie Crust Maker is designed for rolling perfectly round pie crust dough to its optimal size and thickness (for 8-inch, 9.5-inch and deep-dish pies). It zips closed to contain unwanted mess, yet displays contents clearly for easy monitoring, then safely transfers delicate dough to baking dishes without it tearing. No more anxiety over misshapen, uneven, or torn crusts! A must-have of baking accessories, it makes professional-looking pies without the mess. Once pies are ready to bake, the Adjustable Pie Shield covers and gently cradles the crust to shield it from over browning so it bakes through evenly without any burnt edges. The single-piece of silicone adjusts easily to fit from 8-inch to 11.5-inch crusts. Faster and easier than using tin foil. Fits regular and rimmed dishes. For perfectly round pie crust, lightly dust dough with flour and place it inside the Crust Maker. Press the dough flat by hand and sprinkle extra flour if needed. Zip pie crust bag closed to contain billows of flour and sticky mess inside. Roll dough evenly with a rolling pin to fill the Crust Maker. To transfer rolled dough, unzip Crust Maker, center pie dish face down on the dough. Hold baking pan against the dough and turn them upright together, so dough is on top. Gently peel back Crust Maker from dough. Finish assembling the pie, top with the Adjustable Pie Shield, and bake according to recipe. Made from BPA-free plastic, the Pie Crust Maker is strong and durable to outlast thousands of uses. Stays in place during use. Lays flat for compact storage. Turn inside out and hand wash with warm, soapy water. Dry thoroughly before storing. Made from silicone, the Adjustable Pie Shield is heat resistant (to 500-degrees Fahrenheit) and dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Instructions included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HA0O7zUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B06Y2BV42G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2BV42G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2BV42G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
