window.products.push({"id":605535,"name":"Luxurious Duck Down Feather Cushion Decorative Throw Pillow Inner Insert Cushions,Orangic Cotton Cover,Set of 2 24x24inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PTvZ2UUYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Premium Materials & Best Services! For us, at ROSEFEATHER, using superior quality materials is not an option; it is an obligation. That is why we use only premium, 100% hypoallergenic crafting and filling materials for our goose down pillow, because we do not aim in just selling our products. Our true goal is to earn our customers trust and loyalty! PRODUCT DESCRIPTION : Material : 100% Orangic Cotton Cover. Filling : Nature down and feather. Package : Contain TWO cushions. WARMLY REMIND : 1.Hand and Machine washable , it should be totally dry then can be used. 2.Put it under the sun every 3-4 weeks to keep its shape and Fluffy degree. 3.The pillow insert shown on the picture is 3D size.When we deliver it,we will Take out the vacuum and press it.So when you receive it,you need to put it under the sun for one day then can be used. 4.Whether you are using it solely as an accent piece to create interest in your room, or as a functional head pillow, this fashionable bedding accessory offers great looks and endless comfort . 5.This feather and down pillow provides firm support for your neck as you lie in bed - or back support for when you're in a seated position. 6.For best results, your pillow insert should be larger than your sham to correctly fill the corners of the pillow cover, this will provide a very attractive firm and fluffy look to your sham, we recommend to place our inserts in shams that are 1\" or 2\" smaller than the pillow, It would depend on the thickness of the sham, a thick fabric would need a 2\" larger insert to keep it fluffed, a more lighter fabric would need a 1\" lager insert. So, What Are You Waiting For? Place Your Own Order Now Before We Run Out Of Stock!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PTvZ2UUYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSE FEATHER","source_asin":"B00M4SCINS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M4SCINS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M4SCINS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
