window.products.push({"id":605679,"name":"Seeutek Alcohol Still 5Gal 18L Stainless Steel Alcohol Distiller Copper Tube Spirit Boiler with Thumper Keg for Home Brewing and DIY Whisky Wine Brand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115AYMpNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍸 Professional Alcohol Still -- Home copper still, suitable for beginners or professional, easy to use. The alcohol kit adopts an open cooling method. The copper cooling tube has good thermal conductivity and has a larger contact area with the coolant. This makes the whiskey still have excellent cooling performance and increase the wine production speed. 🍸 Alcohol Still -- All parts of the distillery kit are made of food-grade materials, lead-free, high temperature resistance, acid and alkali resistance. The fermenter barrel is specially thickened and supports a variety of heating methods: gas stove, electric ceramic stove, firewood, etc. The buckle on the lid and the silicone gasket make the alcohol distiller have a perfect seal. 🍸 Built-in Thermometer -- The distiller kit contains a metal thermometer, which displays degrees Celsius and Fahrenheit, so you can more accurately grasp the temperature of the fermenter during use. Alcohol still comes with a thumper keg, which can add a unique aroma during the alcohol distillation. You can use fruits, spices, or other flavoring agents. 🍸 Multiple Uses -- You can make all your favorite beverages in the alcohol distiller, such as whiskey, scotch, rum, tequila, brandy, vodka, etc. The spirit still can also be used to distill water, alcohol, and make essential oils. You can also install a one-way gas valve on the lid of the alcohol distiller according to your needs, which is also suitable for home brewing. Note: The alcohol distill comes with a small pump, which is convenient and easy to use. 🍸 Quality Assurance -- Free returns, free parts replacement! The liquor still kit included: fermentation barrel, thumper keg, condenser barrel, one-way valve, corrugated pipe, additional copper pipe, thermometer, silicone hose, sealing kit, user manual. Fermentation Barrel: 11.8\" x 11.8\", Thumper Keg: 7.1\" x 4.1\", Condensing Barrel: 7.9\" x 4.3\". If you have any question during use, please contact the customer service at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115AYMpNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seeutek","source_asin":"B0BNVNZWFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVNZWFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVNZWFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
