window.products.push({"id":605861,"name":"Polaroid Colorful 6'.5\" String Light with 16 LED Photo Clips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zco58kw6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Portray your s with a little sparkle and pride! Shine a light on your favorite photographs, postcards, mementos, and more with this totally clever string light with LED photo clips from ! This exceptionally unique cable features 16 clear clothesline clips with LED bulbs for securely hanging your precious prints and snapshots. You can easily manipulate the flexible 6. 5’ strand to drape and dangle anywhere your heart desires. Simply clasp your photo treasures with the gentle acrylic holders, load the battery pack with 3AA batteries, and behold—a beacon of artsy inspiration! This fairytale find requires no outlet and features a helpful on/flash/off switch to preserve power when not in use. Each individual clip stays cool to the touch to protect your paper and film creations. From the bookcase to the stairwell, the mantle to the Christmas tree, dorm room to family room, you’ll enjoy a twinkling gallery of your greatest memories—with strings attached! What You Get 1 String Light With 16 Photo Clips 16 Built-In LED Bulbs Attached Battery Pack A magical strand of photo creativity! Specs & Details Power: 3 AA batteries [not included] LED Clip Count: 16 Total Length: 6. 5 feet Clip Material: clear acrylic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zco58kw6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polaroid","source_asin":"B0714DDJ3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0714DDJ3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0714DDJ3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":605862,"name":"Desk Chair Ergonomic Office Chair with Adjustable Armrests, Reclining Tilt Function & Breathable Mesh Mid Back Home Office Chair with PU Wheels, Compu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718GEiKwQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝐀𝐃𝐉𝐔𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄 𝐂𝐔𝐒𝐇𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐃 𝐀𝐑𝐌𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐒】Non-slip and sweat-resistant, and will not peel off over time. The 3.5-inch adjustment range supports forearms of people with varying heights, such as men at 5'9\" and women at 5'4\". When not in use or during room cleaning, the armrests can be retracted and the chair pushed under the desk to expand the activity space. 【𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐓 & 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐋𝐈𝐍𝐄𝐑 𝐃𝐔𝐀𝐋 𝐒𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐂𝐇】Feeling tired from independent work or study? Pull out the lever for a quick power nap to regain focus. The backrest has a tilt angle of 90 and 130 degrees, and the sturdy base ensures stability when reclining (Women may need to adjust the tension lower for easier reclining). 【𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐈𝐎𝐑 𝐋𝐎𝐀𝐃 𝐂𝐀𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐈𝐓𝐘】This chair has passed the BIFMA certification and a 1032lb static pressure test, easily handling weights up to 300lb. It features a one-piece star-shaped reinforced nylon base, eliminating the need for complex assembly. It is not prone to breakage and boasts a strong load-bearing capacity. 【𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐈𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐃 𝐁𝐀𝐂𝐊𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓】The mesh backrest provides adequate back support while allowing air to flow freely, preventing sweat accumulation on your back. The thickened sponge seat cushion complements the backrest, easily handling the ups and downs of sitting for 8 hours a day, 5 days a week. It is suitable for corporate users, online meetings, live streamers, and YouTubers. 【𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐓 & 𝐋𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓𝐖𝐄𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓】It can be conveniently moved between different rooms and used in narrow spaces. The casters can roll smoothly on flat floors or carpets, unlike hard plastic casters that generate disruptive noise. Our casters are wrapped with PU material, only producing a whisper, preventing distraction for those focused on other tasks. 【𝟏𝟎-𝐘𝐄𝐀𝐑 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘】Etasker office chairs are durable for decades, offering a 10-year Quality Guarantee and free spare parts. This is the chair primarily used by our team, retaining only the most basic, necessary, and stable features. There are no compromises on the quality of materials and craftsmanship, ensuring that its practical value will not diminish. 【𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐄𝐏𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐀𝐒𝐒𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐍𝐂𝐄】No additional tools are required as the kit includes all the necessary components. Following the video instructions, it can be completed within 20 minutes (usually 30 minutes for the elderly and children). If you encounter any issues, ETasker customer service team will do their utmost to address your concerns and resolve any problems to ensure customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718GEiKwQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ETasker","source_asin":"B0BY987WVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-605862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY987WVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY987WVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
